2, "prompt": "(2) ______             since last one month she had a sing episode of decreased eye vision The\nproblem lasted for about five minutes that occured four weeks ago when while driving the car.\nDuring that time she felt", "sourcePage": 109, "choices": [], "kind": "blank", "answer": {"text": "Pacemaker Placement", "page": 118, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "During that time she felt (3) ______               Subsequent CT scan,", "sourcePage": 109, "choices": [], "kind": "blank", "answer": {"text": "Nauseated And Light Headed", "page": 118, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "Subsequent CT scan, (4) ______\n echocardiogram, and neurological evaluation, all were unremarkable. she couldn’t have an MRI\ndue to the pacemaker placement. no lesions or any change in vision, headaches, change in gait\nor other neurological issues. Drinks socially, doesn’t smoke.", "sourcePage": 109, "choices": [], "kind": "blank", "answer": {"text": "Carotid Dopplers", "page": 118, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "Medications : Plavix, baby aspirin 81 mg per day, (5) ______                 daily and", "sourcePage": 109, "choices": [], "kind": "blank", "answer": {"text": "Proscar 5 Mg", "page": 118, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "daily and (6) ______\ndaily.", "sourcePage": 109, "choices": [], "kind": "blank", "answer": {"text": "Synthroid 0.2 Mg", "page": 118, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 7, "prompt": "Physical Examination : blood pressure 134/80, heart rate 60, (7) ______                  and weight is\n244 pounds.", "sourcePage": 109, "choices": [], "kind": "blank", "answer": {"text": "Respiratory Rate 16", "page": 118, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 8, "prompt": "Diagnosis : Cranial nerves (8) ______                has normal bulk and tone throughout. There is no\ncogwheeling. There is some minimal weakness at the", "sourcePage": 109, "choices": [], "kind": "blank", "answer": {"text": "Ii Through Xii Are Intact", "page": 118, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 9, "prompt": "cogwheeling. There is some minimal weakness at the (9) ______                   4+ or 5 and possibly", "sourcePage": 109, "choices": [], "kind": "blank", "answer": {"text": "Iliopsoas Bilaterally", "page": 118, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 10, "prompt": "trace weakness at the quadriceps -5 or 5. has decreased sensation to (10) ______                only,\notherwise sensory is intact to light touch, and temperature, pinprick, proprioception and\nvibration. There is no dysmetria or tremor noted. Romberg is negative.", "sourcePage": 110, "choices": [], "kind": "blank", "answer": {"text": "Vibration And Proprioception To The Middle Of Feet", "page": 118, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 11, "prompt": "Impression : (11) ______                  his brief episode of visual loss is concerning for compromise of\nthe posterior circulation. Differential diagnoses include hypoperfusion, stenosis, and dissection.\nHas", "sourcePage": 110, "choices": [], "kind": "blank", "answer": {"text": "Transient Ischemic Attack.", "page": 118, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 12, "prompt": "the posterior circulation. Differential diagnoses include hypoperfusion, stenosis, and dissection.\nHas (12) ______              The symptoms are very mild and consist mainly of some mild proximal\nupper extremity weakness and very mild gait instability.", "sourcePage": 110, "choices": [], "kind": "blank", "answer": {"text": "Lumbar Stenosis", "page": 118, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 13, "prompt": "Patient’s description of symptoms: has (13) ______                set at 90 m.m.H.2.O. Recently\ngetting acute onset of headaches and is worsening day by day. patient couldn’t sleep. pain is\nconstant worsens with", "sourcePage": 110, "choices": [], "kind": "blank", "answer": {"text": "Codman-hakim Shunt", "page": 118, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 14, "prompt": "constant worsens with (14) ______                  as well as on standing up. she took Imitrex and", "sourcePage": 110, "choices": [], "kind": "blank", "answer": {"text": "Coughing, Straining, And Sneezing", "page": 118, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resource